      "example": "Titan Bank completed its Master War Room Audit: successfully surviving a $2.8B deposit run via TREPS repo, monetizing a $288M auction devolution via When-Issued forward hedging, shielding $792M in bond assets via HTM accounting, and crushing its Duration Gap from +3.63 yrs to +0.33 yrs via IRS swaps, preserving full Tier-1 capital.",
      "code": "def run_master_treasury_war_room_audit(\n    liquidity_restored: bool = True,\n    post_cum_liquidity_gap_pct: float = -0.22,\n    devolution_carry_income_usd: float = 858360.0,\n    wi_arbitrage_gain_usd: float = 105000.0,\n    htm_accounting_savings_usd_m: float = 792.0,\n    convexity_savings_usd_m: float = 46.8,\n    post_hedge_dgap_years: float = 0.33,\n    post_hedge_capital_erosion_pct: float = 6.17,\n    basel_outlier_limit_pct: float = 15.0\n) -> dict:\n    # Master Treasury & ALM Capstone Solvency Audit Engine\n    liquidity_status = post_cum_liquidity_gap_pct >= -10.0 and liquidity_restored\n    capital_status = post_hedge_capital_erosion_pct <= basel_outlier_limit_pct\n    total_arbitrage_and_carry = devolution_carry_income_usd + wi_arbitrage_gain_usd\n    total_accounting_and_convexity_savings_m = htm_accounting_savings_usd_m + convexity_savings_usd_m\n    \n    all_pillars_passed = liquidity_status and capital_status\n    \n    return {\n        'pillar_1_liquidity_restored': liquidity_status,\n        'final_liquidity_gap_pct': post_cum_liquidity_gap_pct,\n        'pillar_2_devolution_carry_profit': round(total_arbitrage_and_carry, 2),\n        'pillar_3_total_savings_m': round(total_accounting_and_convexity_savings_m, 2),\n        'pillar_4_post_hedge_dgap_years': post_hedge_dgap_years,\n        'pillar_4_capital_erosion_pct': post_hedge_capital_erosion_pct,\n        'basel_iii_irrbb_compliant': capital_status,\n        'supervisory_camels_rating': 'RATING_1_STRONG' if all_pillars_passed else 'RATING_4_UNSATISFACTORY',\n        'enterprise_solvency_defended': all_pillars_passed\n    }\n\nmaster_audit = run_master_treasury_war_room_audit()\nprint(\"=== Titan National Bank - Master Treasury War Room Audit Scorecard ===\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 1: Structural Liquidity Defense:   PASS (Final Gap: {master_audit['final_liquidity_gap_pct']}% vs -10.0% Limit)\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 2: Devolution & When-Issued P&L:   PASS (+${master_audit['pillar_2_devolution_carry_profit']:,.2f} Total Gain)\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 3: HTM & Convexity MTM Savings:   PASS (+${master_audit['pillar_3_total_savings_m']:,.1f} Million Protected)\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 4: Enterprise Duration Immunization:PASS (DGAP: +{master_audit['pillar_4_post_hedge_dgap_years']} yrs | EVE Loss: {master_audit['pillar_4_capital_erosion_pct']}%)\")\nprint(\"\\n--- Central Bank Regulatory Inspection Sign-Off ---\")\nprint(f\"Basel III IRRBB Outlier Compliance:      {master_audit['basel_iii_irrbb_compliant']} (Capital Fully Defended!)\")\nprint(f\"Supervisory CAMELS Institutional Rating: {master_audit['supervisory_camels_rating']}\")\nprint(f\"Final Enterprise Solvency Status:        DEFENDED AND VERIFIED: {master_audit['enterprise_solvency_defended']}\")",
      "output": "=== Titan National Bank - Master Treasury War Room Audit Scorecard ===\nPillar 1: Structural Liquidity Defense:   PASS (Final Gap: -0.22% vs -10.0% Limit)\nPillar 2: Devolution & When-Issued P&L:   PASS (+$963,360.00 Total Gain)\nPillar 3: HTM & Convexity MTM Savings:   PASS (+$838.8 Million Protected)\nPillar 4: Enterprise Duration Immunization:PASS (DGAP: +0.33 yrs | EVE Loss: 6.17%)\n\n--- Central Bank Regulatory Inspection Sign-Off ---\nBasel III IRRBB Outlier Compliance:      True (Capital Fully Defended!)\nSupervisory CAMELS Institutional Rating: RATING_1_STRONG\nFinal Enterprise Solvency Status:        DEFENDED AND VERIFIED: True",
