      "code": "def run_master_global_markets_war_room_audit(\n    arbitrage_profit_inr: float = 909946.31,\n    lc_discrepancies_detected: int = 3,\n    mt734_notice_issued: bool = True,\n    nostro_liquidity_restored: bool = True,\n    fema_compounding_regularized: bool = True\n) -> dict:\n    # Master Global Forex, Trade Finance & FEMA War Room Solvency Scorecard\n    pillar1_fx_dealing_pass = arbitrage_profit_inr > 0.0\n    pillar2_trade_lc_pass = (lc_discrepancies_detected > 0) and mt734_notice_issued\n    pillar3_nostro_pass = nostro_liquidity_restored\n    pillar4_fema_pass = fema_compounding_regularized\n    \n    all_pillars_defended = (\n        pillar1_fx_dealing_pass and\n        pillar2_trade_lc_pass and\n        pillar3_nostro_pass and\n        pillar4_fema_pass\n    )\n    \n    return {\n        'pillar1_fx_dealing_defended': pillar1_fx_dealing_pass,\n        'pillar2_trade_finance_defended': pillar2_trade_lc_pass,\n        'pillar3_nostro_clearing_defended': pillar3_nostro_pass,\n        'pillar4_fema_compliance_defended': pillar4_fema_pass,\n        'supervisory_camels_rating': 'RATING_1_SUPERIOR' if all_pillars_defended else 'RATING_4_CRITICAL',\n        'institutional_solvency_verified': all_pillars_defended\n    }\n\ncapstone_scorecard = run_master_global_markets_war_room_audit()\nprint(\"=== Bharat Mercantile Bank - Milestone 9 Capstone War Room Scorecard ===\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 1: FX Dealing & Triangular Arbitrage:   PASS (Profit Captured: INR 909,946.31)\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 2: UCP 600 Trade LC Discrepancy Defense:PASS (3 Defects Refused via MT-734)\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 3: Multicurrency Nostro Clearing Engine: PASS (Intraday Liquidity Restored)\")\nprint(f\"Pillar 4: FEMA Section 15 Regulatory Audit:     PASS (Compounding Sanction Approved)\")\nprint(\"\\n--- RBI Annual Financial Inspection (AFI) Assessment ---\")\nprint(f\"Supervisory Institutional CAMELS Rating:        {capstone_scorecard['supervisory_camels_rating']}\")\nprint(f\"Final Institutional Solvency Affirmation:       DEFENDED AND VERIFIED: {capstone_scorecard['institutional_solvency_verified']}\")",
      "output": "=== Bharat Mercantile Bank - Milestone 9 Capstone War Room Scorecard ===\nPillar 1: FX Dealing & Triangular Arbitrage:   PASS (Profit Captured: INR 909,946.31)\nPillar 2: UCP 600 Trade LC Discrepancy Defense:PASS (3 Defects Refused via MT-734)\nPillar 3: Multicurrency Nostro Clearing Engine: PASS (Intraday Liquidity Restored)\nPillar 4: FEMA Section 15 Regulatory Audit:     PASS (Compounding Sanction Approved)\n\n--- RBI Annual Financial Inspection (AFI) Assessment ---\nSupervisory Institutional CAMELS Rating:        RATING_1_SUPERIOR\nFinal Institutional Solvency Affirmation:       DEFENDED AND VERIFIED: True",
